# The install test's units (a test file, or a file and one of its cases) that take 10 s or more from the install,
# slowest first, as measured, eight at a time on 16 cores, with each one's seconds. closure.test.sh starts these first
# and the rest after, so no long unit starts last. Re-measure and rewrite this list when a unit's time changes a lot;
# a unit missing from it still runs.
